WEBVTT

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.360
Out!

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.600
Don't jump to any conclusions, okay?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.540
It's not like I've been
taking it easy up till now.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:25.750
Headfirst slides don't make you any faster,
you can get hurt, and there's no real upside.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:31.710
I just wanted to get my uniform 
as dirty as everyone else's.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:11.050
Okay, we got two runs back!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:15.940
<b>The Unexpected Pitcher</b>

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:12.900
The momentum's with us!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.650
The real fight starts here!

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.080
Yeah!

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.150
We're three runs ahead.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:24.500
I didn't expect them to narrow the gap.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:29.000
We need to disrupt their rhythm here
before they build up a real head of steam.

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:30.370
Yeah.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.510
Oh! She's pitching this inning, too?!

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:45.680
You got this, Chisato!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:49.080
So Chisato-chan can even
play as a long reliever?

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:53.520
Hm, well, I don't think
she's done it all that much before,

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.450
but it should be a piece 
of cake for my Chisato.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:00.870
She's got real talent and excels
at anything she turns her hand to!

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:02.110
Huh.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:03.400
No, I mean it.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.210
She takes after me in that regard!

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:06.360
<i>Bottom of the fifth.</i>

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:06.830
Sorry, what?

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:08.250
<i>Oobi Middle to bat.</i>

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.250
You got this, Chisato!

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:12.070
<i>Batting first, second base, Idemitsu-kun.</i>

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:14.830
<i>We faced the bottom
of their order last inning,</i>

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.680
<i>but we've cycled back
to the top for this inning.</i>

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.260
Play!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.430
<i>Please get us through this somehow, Chisato!</i>

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.490
Nice, Idemitsu!

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:31.630
Follow it up, Michiru!

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:41.600
<i>This is bad. It's early in the inning
and Chisato hasn't found her form yet.</i>

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:44.640
<i>But we just started
believing we can catch up.</i>

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:52.460
<i>There's no way we can let them
pull further ahead this inning.</i>

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.540
Chisato, focus!

00:03:58.770 --> 00:03:59.550
Ball!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.980
Hey, lead, lead, lead!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:06.610
Ball two!

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.250
<i>She can't get it in the strike zone.</i>

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.980
Senpai.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.730
Timeout.

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:19.430
What's up? Is something wrong?

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:23.200
I'm sorry, I didn't want to say this,

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:25.410
but I'm way too tired to pitch.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.580
Maybe it's because
I haven't pitched in ages,

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.660
but my grip strength suddenly
deserted me this inning.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.060
H-Hold on a sec! Don't do this to me, Chisato!

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:38.130
We don't have any other pitchers!

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:39.250
What's going on?

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.880
I guess Chisato could only
handle being a short reliever.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:49.680
You can focus solely on your control.
Please, just get us through this inning.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:54.350
I'll come up with a plan for beyond that,
like putting Nishina in again or something.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.150
Huh? Uh, all right.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:01.430
Play!

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.460
<i>That's easier said than done, though.</i>

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:11.650
Foul!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.250
See? I told you.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:19.780
They're out of pitchers, huh?

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.210
Fujii can't pitch two innings.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:26.070
Ball three!

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.480
This blows!

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.310
Ball! Ball four!

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.140
It looks like Chisato-chan's
reached her limit.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:39.270
Are you okay, Chisato? You got 
tired between innings, didn't you?

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.450
You poor thing.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:46.400
Hey, Daigo! Why are you forcing 
her to be a long reliever?!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:50.450
You literally just said she takes
after you and can do <i>anything</i>...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.470
<i>Chisato can't go on like this.</i>

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.670
I-I'm sorry. We need a timeout, please.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:01.890
Timeout!

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:04.980
Daigo.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.400
Want me to pitch?

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:10.210
Huh?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.260
Huh?!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.680
You want to pitch, Sawa-san?!

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:17.480
What's with that reaction?
It's not like I've never pitched before.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.610
Really?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:26.280
But you never mentioned that when
we were choosing positions way back.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.920
I'll take second.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.910
Shortstop for me, then.

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:34.120
Well, pitcher's the most tiring position,
and it's a heck of a lot of responsibility.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.160
Why would I volunteer for that?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:39.330
<b><i>That's</i> your reason?</b>

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:39.330
<b><i>That's</i> your reason?</b>

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:39.330
<b><i>That's</i> your reason?</b>

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.330
<i></i>That's<i> your reason?</i>

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.460
But are you sure about this?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.540
You haven't pitched in a long time, right?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:49.400
And you haven't warmed up your arm.
Isn't that jumping in at the deep end?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:54.260
Deep end or not, I gotta do something
to get that glum look off your face.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.180
I may not have pitched in a while,

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.610
but that doesn't mean
I can't find the strike zone.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.980
Well, I'll see what I can do.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:13.660
<i>Field change for Fuurin Academy.</i>

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.580
<i>Sawa-san moves from second base to pitcher.</i>

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.580
A switch?

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:20.830
<i>Fujii-san moves from pitcher to second base.</i>

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.290
What? Did she say Sawa?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.880
Can she even still pitch?

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.410
Yayoi.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:41.460
Hey, you're not serious, right? I mean, you—

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.400
Shush.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.270
Daigo will hear you.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:49.990
He won't shut up if he finds out, 
so you can't tell him.

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.640
Last one!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:04.890
<i>They're pretty good.</i>

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:09.340
<i>The speed's decent and
the control's not bad, either.</i>

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:13.040
<i>Batting third, shortstop, Seko-kun.</i>

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:15.450
Oh, I'm sorry. Gimme a sec.

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.890
What's going on? Please hurry it up.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.730
Right. I'm ready now.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.200
Play!

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.180
Strike!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.680
No way... That was fast.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.750
<i>You gotta be kidding.</i>

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.770
<i>Her pitches look even more intense now,
despite what happened.</i>

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:09.230
Incredible.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:15.200
<i>You... You don't have to go overboard, Yayoi.</i>

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:19.810
Foul!

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.110
<i>Is this real?</i>

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:25.060
<i>Sawa-san could pitch like this all along?</i>

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.170
<i>Why didn't she tell me?</i>

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.460
Ball!

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:33.330
<i>She's only thrown fastballs so far.</i>

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.680
<i>I remember, even back then,
she was already pitching breaking balls.</i>

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:43.180
Foul!

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:50.290
<i>Not bad, Sekocchi. Fastballs 
aren't enough against you.</i>

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.320
Daigo!

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:55.130
Timeout!

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:03.830
<i>She has an arm like that and
didn't even try out for Senior?</i>

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.890
<i>Now it's even clearer that I can't afford
to lose to these ambitionless time-wasters.</i>

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.430
Huh? You can throw breaking balls too?

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.220
Yep.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.260
So you can call my pitches.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.850
Curveballs, shootballs, sliders...

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.190
I can throw whatever you want.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.620
But I've never seen you throw any of those.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.270
I don't know which one I should pick.

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:37.470
What pitch do you feel 
most comfortable with?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.030
Play!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.620
The one I feel most comfortable with?

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.580
I guess that'd be...

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.520
...the forkball.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.830
You're out!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.610
Heck yeah!

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:17.920
What was that just now?

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:19.700
A forkball?

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.620
One out, you guys!

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:29.250
I expected another fastball,
but it nosedived.

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:33.710
<i>I heard rubber-ball forkballs
didn't sink all that sharply.</i>

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.620
<i>Sawa-san, you're something else!</i>

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:40.300
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Uozumi-kun.</i>

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.930
<i>So you've still got it, huh, Sawa?</i>

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.860
<i>We might've been evenly matched 
back then, but not now.</i>

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:50.020
<i>I refuse to accept that any girl other
than Michiru is up to my standard!</i>

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.540
Strike!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.920
<i>Another breaking ball? And a forkball, too.</i>

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:59.700
<i>That's the worst choice of pitch, Yayoi!</i>

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.110
Foul!

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:04.840
<i>We need some more runs.</i>

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:09.330
<i>If we don't score any runs here,
the momentum will be with them.</i>

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.500
<i>We absolutely must...</i>

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:14.540
<i>...get more runs!</i>

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.510
Yes, it went through!

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:36.460
Out!

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:39.220
Yes! We survived!

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:41.490
Nice double play, Tao!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.530
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.530
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.530
<b>Oobi</b>

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.370
Damn, we got nothing.

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.940
Thanks. You're a lifesaver.

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:06.500
Yeah, I saved you. Because I want
you to pitch as little as possible.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.780
Yayoi, that was amazing!

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:19.570
Why'd you wait till now to pitch for us
when you have an arm like that?

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.850
Yeah, seriously. Not cool, man.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.540
You probably woulda been
made ace on the spot.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:29.940
Nah, no way. I just rode my luck
and it all worked out this time.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.660
That wasn't riding your luck!

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:35.880
I guess Sawa-senpai's okay, then?

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:35.210
You'll make me mad,
saying stuff like that, Yayoi!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:39.630
I gotta say, the way that forkball
sank was pretty darn brutal.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:42.090
Two innings left.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:46.050
This inning with Sawa and the meat
of their order is our biggest challenge.

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.700
Nice and steady, Michiru.

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:50.980
I know.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:54.980
<i>Batting third, pitcher, Sawa-san.</i>

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:57.700
Let's go! We're on fire!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.070
Strike!

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.030
<i>Looks like she's not gonna
give me any easy fastballs.</i>

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:12.990
<i>Then, I'll have to swing...</i>

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:15.660
<i>...when she tries to rack up the count...</i>

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.250
<i>...with a breaking ball!</i>

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.510
Yeah!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.060
Nice batting!

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:35.630
<i>Damn you, Sawa.</i>

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:38.940
<i>She managed to hit Michiru's
slider on her first swing!</i>

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:42.520
<i>That was crazy good. Now, it's my turn.</i>

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:47.520
Isn't that the first time the first
batter in the inning got a base hit?

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:50.340
Yeah. The game's turning in our favor!

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.120
Keep it going, Daigo!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.870
Pop

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:57.860
<i>Bah, why's that idiot ignoring his messages?</i>

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:02.440
<i>The game's almost over! Is he really
gonna miss this all-important final?!</i>

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:05.940
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Shigeno-kun.</i>

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.640
You got this, Daigo!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.180
Keep us motorin'!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.080
Strike!

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:15.360
<i>So fast!</i>

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:19.810
<i>But Sawa-san and the others
got us to this point...</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.110
Strike two!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.320
<i>I need to do this...</i>

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.320
<i>...and set up something big!</i>

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:37.830
Out!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:39.540
Out!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.330
Aw, heck no! A double play?

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:48.210
Gah! Seriously? A double play?!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.880
Well, damn. You serious, captain?

00:15:54.740 --> 00:15:55.740
Sorry.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:02.270
H-Hey! Don't go getting all depressed!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.590
I'll smash one outta the park
and create a chance for us!

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:06.730
Please do.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:13.440
Strike three! You're out!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:25.680
<i>Why was I so hasty to get
something on that slider?</i>

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:30.070
<i>The captain can't waste a chance like that.</i>

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:32.550
Daigo!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.600
Why are you spacing out?

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.640
You shouldn't keep the pitcher waiting.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:39.290
Oh, uh, right.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:48.700
Out!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.450
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.450
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.450
<b>Oobi</b>

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.590
Nice pitchin', Senpai.

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.950
Thanks.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.290
Okay, it's the last inning!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.000
Let's get these next three
out and go to Regionals!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Sagara</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Sawa</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Shigeno</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Nishina</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Kabashima</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Tanba</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Kandori</b>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.960
<b>Sakura</b>

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:07.650
<i>Top of the seventh.</i>

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.600
<i>Fuurin Academy to bat.</i>

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.420
<i>Right. Three up, three down to end this.</i>

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:15.120
<i>Batting sixth, left field, Kabashima-san.</i>

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:21.000
<i>For my own sake, and for the guys
who quit Senior to play alongside me,</i>

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.350
<i>I'll take the middle school rubber-ball crown!</i>

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.160
Go get 'em!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.170
Please, Anita!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.690
You hafta get on base, Anita!

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.540
We still have a chance here!

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.590
Yes!

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:41.450
It went through!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.200
Yes! We got a runner!

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.530
Nice batting!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.460
We can get those three runs easy!

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.080
<i>Who on earth are these girls?</i>

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.340
<i>How can they hit my pitches so easily?!</i>

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:02.810
<i>Calm down, Michiru. The only ones 
with skill are the ex-Little players.</i>

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.950
<i>Batting seventh, first base, Tanba-kun.</i>

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.610
<i>Get their bottom three
batters out and it's over!</i>

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.730
Tanba! Ya'd better do this!

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.030
Hey, he's two years older than you.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.890
Strike three! You're out!

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:28.850
Sorry.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:30.780
No worries!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.540
Leave it to me.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.280
Oh, yeah, southpaws are her specialty!

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:41.680
She might actually pull somethin' off again!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:50.880
Out!

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.590
<i>One to go.</i>

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:01.470
<i>Batting ninth, right field, Sakura-san.</i>

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.750
<i>I'm not giving up!</i>

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:15.880
<i>I don't want to lose!</i>

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:20.480
<i>So fast...</i>

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:22.050
<i>But...</i>

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.180
<i>...I want a hit!</i>

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:26.290
Foul!

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.600
Good swing! That'll get ya a hit!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:31.740
Foul!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.060
Foul!

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:38.360
Foul!

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:43.700
<i>I swear... I'm going to get you!</i>

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:45.910
<i>So annoying!</i>

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.080
Foul!

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.750
Mutsu! You can do it!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.800
Stay tough!

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.380
Foul!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:04.900
Mutsuko...

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.380
Come on, pull yourself together.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.000
This game's not over yet.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.460
Y-Yeah...

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:17.940
Is it the double play earlier
that's getting you down?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:22.610
No, I just can't face you guys 
when you've been working so hard.

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.180
Not after the captain and cleanup
wrecked the team's chances.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.750
How dense are you?

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:37.130
Here.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:41.130
You're the one who's been 
working the hardest up to now.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:46.670
As our catcher and our captain,
you've been carrying us this whole time.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:49.100
So why beat yourself up
over one measly double play?

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:54.730
We're your team, Daigo.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:56.910
So chin up!

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:02.160
Mutsuko! Keep us alive!

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:07.530
All right!

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:16.790
What?!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:18.500
Yeah!

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:20.650
Stop, stop!

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:33.910
<i>Nice, Mutsuko!</i>

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.940
<i>Two outs, runners on first and third!</i>

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:37.480
<i>Our chances are much better now!</i>

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:40.500
<i>Dammit.</i>

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.540
<i>What a time to make an error.</i>

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:46.580
<i>So you're gonna make me struggle for this, huh?</i>

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:50.280
<i>But this ends now.</i>

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:00.750
<i>I </i>will<i> win this game with my pitching!</i>

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:16.240
Three runs behind and
two outs in the last inning?

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:18.020
Well, isn't this fun?

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:26.710
I call this the starting line
 in baseball, Daigo!

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:01.340
How?

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:04.100
Even boys can't get good hits on my pitches.

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:05.920
What is it with these girls?!

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:07.520
I wonder why...

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:10.510
I wasn't planning on trying this hard.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:11.770
I know...

00:24:11.770 --> 00:24:15.890
I know this will be the only time
I get to play alongside these guys!

00:24:16.230 --> 00:24:18.680
Captain, we've come this far. We gotta win!

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.080
Let's kick it up a notch!

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:22.620
Next time: "We've Come This Far."

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.980
<b>We've Come This Far</b>

00:24:22.620 --> 00:24:24.760
Run to the stage of your dreams!
